            That is expensive for plant protein. Organic plant proteins from bigger brands such as Orgain and Sunwarrior generally run about $1.40 to $2.50 per 25 g, per our reviews of those brands. You are paying for a short, organic, gum-free label and a whole-food superfood blend, not for more protein. Original is the only Epic bag that comes close to mainstream value.
